{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y在S02、S04、S13的感受提示偶尔堆叠过密，少数比喻彼此争夺注意力，反而削弱了个别音乐瞬间的辨识度。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y的话语重点有明显的视觉锚点，话与感受交替出现，又有音乐到时才出现的提示，观众更容易在听音乐时迅速抓住当前情绪和叙事变化。它对人物心理的因果解释更细，尤其从害怕给对方负担、逐渐感到被需要，到害怕失去、最终不再隐藏喜欢，前后转变更容易跟上。感受部分也更贴近具体的音乐走向和身体体验，不只是给情绪贴标签；虽然局部稍显拥挤，但整体的细腻度、叙事连续性和视听对应都更好。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "4192bb94-085c-4b40-b4c3-656461f91202", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261108T011141014824Z", "elapsed_seconds": 55.875, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T01:12:36.900099+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "683531b13e2bbe7f1fa98c44d05db3f0d802b92b5e9a8e31b8f41d04c89403c7", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\